   "text": "1 the pod sends to 10.244.1.2   2 the route says: through flannel.1   3 flannel.1 finds worker-1's tunnel MAC and real IP   4 the kernel wraps the frame in UDP\n5 virbr0 delivers it like any other packet between VMs   6 worker-1's kernel sees port 8472, unwraps it, and routes the original packet to pod B",
